{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/88540dde56fe4e75b6ec281957699245.avif?t=1771863937\" width=1512 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant corner of the universe, where countless alien factions coexist with their own customs and cultures, one thing brings together all those who hold even a fragment of power: <strong>a taste for conflict</strong>. Hence the AESOS slogan\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/0210c10063306c8bb397c4d26bb3bce4.avif?t=1771863937\" width=1512 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>AESOS</strong>, you play as an astronautical engineer running a small spacecraft manufacturing company. Assemble cockpits, thrusters, stabilization systems, and\u2014if needed\u2014laser cannons to create ships capable of traversing the darkest reaches of the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/5f58084efb5dd2141328e74a5a24dd3d.poster.avif?t=1771863937\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/5f58084efb5dd2141328e74a5a24dd3d.webm?t=1771863937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/5f58084efb5dd2141328e74a5a24dd3d.mp4?t=1771863937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Services</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits and reputation by selling your ships to clients: some have contracts with requirements as long as your arm\u2014<strong>but you\u2019re an expert, aren\u2019t you</strong>? And you\u2019ll need those credits to buy larger hangars anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/55893a7f6874aa9c35546d3f6319707a.poster.avif?t=1771863937\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/55893a7f6874aa9c35546d3f6319707a.webm?t=1771863937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astronefs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the pilot\u2019s seat in your own creations to prove to your clients that they can trust them\u2014and you! A dive through the rings of a giant planet, the tactical destruction of a heavily defended target, or a high-speed obstacle course to deliver a critical package\u2014<strong>nothing is beyond your reach</strong>, because the clients demand it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/47a5d3523b8c382b41f527a470be5b5f.poster.avif?t=1771863937\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/47a5d3523b8c382b41f527a470be5b5f.webm?t=1771863937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/47a5d3523b8c382b41f527a470be5b5f.mp4?t=1771863937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960190?t=1771863937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/0e5122e8ceef9404301b9d8c463e56858051ccef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771863937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/cf59db77cd5ffc9cd512118d07c1934021083249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771863937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/cf59db77cd5ffc9cd512118d07c1934021083249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771863937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4415830,"description":""},{"appid":4415830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/88540dde56fe4e75b6ec281957699245.avif?t=1771863937\" width=1512 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant corner of the universe, where countless alien factions coexist with their own customs and cultures, one thing brings together all those who hold even a fragment of power: <strong>a taste for conflict</strong>. Hence the AESOS slogan\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extras/0210c10063306c8bb397c4d26bb3bce4.avif?t=1771863937\" width=1512 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>AESOS</strong>, you play as an astronautical engineer running a small spacecraft manufacturing company. Assemble cockpits, thrusters, stabilization systems, and\u2014if needed\u2014laser cannons to create ships capable of traversing the darkest reaches of the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960190/extr